type: software
title: "Secant Varieties of Segre Products Need Not Be Cohen-Macaulay"
authors:
  - given-names: "Wenqi"
    family-names: "Zhu"
    affiliation: "Mathematical Institute, Woodstock Road, University of Oxford, Oxford, UK, OX2 6GG"
